m 0 0 l 200 0 200 370 0 370

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:43.020
I'm getting hungry, mister.

00:17:43.490 --> 00:17:45.950
Hey, mister, are you listening?

00:17:49.430 --> 00:17:51.030
I'm starving.

00:17:51.030 --> 00:17:53.420
And I'm not getting that job.

00:17:53.830 --> 00:17:55.390
Whatever.

00:17:55.660 --> 00:17:59.620
Someone's going to die soon and
 this theater's going to get shut down.

00:17:59.620 --> 00:18:01.440
I won't let the murder happen.

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:04.430
That's why I was called here.

00:18:05.110 --> 00:18:08.920
Neither the theater nor the municipal 
police are taking the threat seriously.

00:18:09.830 --> 00:18:13.080
Regardless of the motivation 
behind the threat...

00:18:13.080 --> 00:18:14.510
It's not a threat.

00:18:15.430 --> 00:18:17.900
It's not a threat. It's a warning.

00:18:18.250 --> 00:18:21.730
A threat always offers two options.

00:18:21.730 --> 00:18:24.630
"Do ABC, or I will do XYZ."

00:18:24.630 --> 00:18:26.180
That's a threat.

00:18:26.180 --> 00:18:29.580
But right now, all we have is a warning 
saying "we're going to kill a performer."

00:18:29.580 --> 00:18:34.030
So, it's not a threat so 
much as a declaration.

00:18:34.030 --> 00:18:37.500
The attacker hasn't made any 
demands of the theater to begin with.

00:18:38.280 --> 00:18:40.340
When did you realize that?

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:42.680
When I heard what the letter said.

00:18:46.190 --> 00:18:48.740
When did you realize the 
secretary was the murderer?

00:18:49.650 --> 00:18:50.800
From the beginning.

00:18:52.290 --> 00:18:56.430
<i>This boy must see truth.</i>

00:18:57.500 --> 00:19:00.140
Why didn't you say anything, if you knew?

00:19:00.560 --> 00:19:06.360
I didn't think you'd misinterpreted 
the warning as a threat.

00:19:06.710 --> 00:19:14.620
Do you believe everyone else
 notices all the things you notice?

00:19:15.410 --> 00:19:17.520
No documents have been stolen,

00:19:17.520 --> 00:19:20.900
and the assassin didn't kill the president.

00:19:22.160 --> 00:19:25.370
The reason you aren't introducing 
him to the municipal police

00:19:25.370 --> 00:19:27.890
is because you want him to 
keep an eye on the police.

00:19:28.850 --> 00:19:34.740
<i>This boy doesn't understand that 
nobody else knows anything.</i>

00:19:35.810 --> 00:19:39.110
<i>He's convinced that everyone 
else already knows the truth</i>

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:42.650
<i>and is simply hiding the 
fact that they know.</i>

00:19:44.020 --> 00:19:47.040
Boy, what can you gather of me,
 from what you see?

00:19:48.340 --> 00:19:50.770
You said you have nowhere
 to stay tonight.

00:19:50.770 --> 00:19:52.140
I don't.

00:19:52.140 --> 00:19:55.060
You can stay the night at my place.

00:19:55.390 --> 00:19:56.660
Your place?

00:19:56.660 --> 00:19:57.550
Yeah.

00:19:57.550 --> 00:19:58.820
So, tell me.

00:19:59.310 --> 00:20:02.070
Tell me anything you notice about me.

00:20:02.070 --> 00:20:05.660
Grown-ups sure do love their quid pro quos.

00:20:06.560 --> 00:20:09.800
I've only just met you, 
so there isn't much I can tell...

00:20:10.020 --> 00:20:12.310
You're in your early thirties.

00:20:12.310 --> 00:20:14.600
You're a bodyguard.

00:20:14.600 --> 00:20:16.060
A master of martial arts.

00:20:16.060 --> 00:20:17.130
Single.

00:20:17.130 --> 00:20:18.470
No coworkers.

00:20:18.470 --> 00:20:19.390
Right-handed.

00:20:19.770 --> 00:20:22.380
You chose a seat by the 
wall at the restaurant,

00:20:22.380 --> 00:20:24.360
so you must be a swordsman, as well.

00:20:24.610 --> 00:20:27.860
I guess that the reason you don't
 use your katana for work anymore

00:20:27.860 --> 00:20:29.930
is because you're ashamed of your last job.

00:20:30.920 --> 00:20:33.640
What's a job that involves swordplay 
and that you'd be ashamed of?

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:38.580
Come to think of it, there was some buzz 
about an incident a few years ago...

00:20:38.580 --> 00:20:43.950
Pro-war bureaucrats and overseas 
military cliques were found dead

00:20:43.950 --> 00:20:46.850
one after another during the 
peace treaty debates.

00:20:47.170 --> 00:20:52.450
And you were grimacing a bit as you looked 
at the newspaper headline in the shop earlier.

