00:20:53.100 --> 00:20:54.600
Are you—

00:20:54.600 --> 00:20:56.320
Silence!

00:21:04.960 --> 00:21:05.960
I'm sorry.

00:21:05.960 --> 00:21:07.160
Are you all right?

00:21:11.290 --> 00:21:12.180
Yeah.

00:21:12.630 --> 00:21:13.650
I'm fine.

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:17.100
<i>This boy's the real deal.</i>

00:21:20.460 --> 00:21:23.820
Boy, help me with this job.

00:21:23.820 --> 00:21:27.700
If we manage to do well, 
I'll introduce you to more work.

00:21:28.400 --> 00:21:29.420
Well?

00:21:29.420 --> 00:21:30.730
Okay.

00:21:31.180 --> 00:21:32.270
I'll help.

00:21:35.310 --> 00:21:37.360
<i>The doors will now open.</i>

00:21:37.360 --> 00:21:40.440
<i>Please make your way to the theater.</i>

00:21:53.490 --> 00:21:55.340
<i>What the hell am I doing?</i>

00:21:56.530 --> 00:22:00.700
<i>I already decided that I'd work alone.</i>

00:22:05.550 --> 00:22:06.480
Let's go.

